    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, those are good points. i also want to make sure the manifesto is well-rounded so people don't just call us one-sided. what would someone on the other side say is the main downside to focusing so much on preserving one specific traditional culture? like, what are the common arguments for a more multicultural or rapidly changing approach?",
